        <h2 style="margin-top:14px">From Sydney to Cairns —<br/>with the same playbook.</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top:22px">
          {{ site.name }} started as a small Sydney outfit and grew up on the kind of word-of-mouth you can't buy. We can deliver everything from the simplest painting tasks to complex and intricate special finishes — and we approach every project, irrespective of cost or size, with the aim of delivering a hassle-free service from quoting to completion.
        </p>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px">
          We achieve that through solid communication with clients and a strong background in project management — consistently delivering high quality painting, decorating and handyman services across Cairns. {{ site.name }} is fully insured and Work, Health and Safety compliant. Smaller team. Tighter standards. Same family running it.
        </p>
        <blockquote>
          "Sound advice, expert professional painters, tried &amp; tested materials, and good old-fashioned quality service — come standard when working with {{ site.name }}."
          <cite>— {{ site.owner.split(' ')[0] }}, {{ site.name }}</cite>
